### npx hyperframes init --help ###
Scaffold a new composition project (hyperframes init v0.8.188)

USAGE hyperframes init [OPTIONS] [NAME]

ARGUMENTS

  NAME    Project name

OPTIONS

            -e, --example=<example>    Example name (e.g. warm-grain, swiss-grid, blank)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
          -t, --template=<template>    [renamed] Use --example instead.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
                -v, --video=<video>    Path to a video file (MP4, WebM, MOV)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
  -V, --video-legacy=<video_legacy>    [renamed] Use --video (or -v) instead of -V.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
                -a, --audio=<audio>    Path to an audio file (MP3, WAV, M4A)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                  --skip-transcribe    Skip whisper transcription                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                    --keep-original    Copy the --video file as is, without converting it to H.264 MP4                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                    --model=<model>    Whisper model for transcription (e.g. tiny.en, base.en, small.en, medium.en, large)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
              --language=<language>    Language code for transcription (e.g. en, es, ja). Filters out non-target speech.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                  --non-interactive    Disable interactive prompts (for CI/agents)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
                            --agent    Deprecated alias; default init is the centered blank                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
                      --skip-skills    [temporarily ignored] init always checks AI skills against GitHub while the skills.sh registry catches up; set HYPERFRAMES_SKIP_SKILLS=1 to opt out (CI/tests)                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                         --tailwind    Add Tailwind CSS browser-runtime support                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
          --resolution=<resolution>    Canvas resolution preset: landscape (1920x1080), portrait (1080x1920), landscape-4k (3840x2160), portrait-4k (2160x3840), square (1080x1080), square-4k (2160x2160). Aliases: 1080p, 4k, uhd, 1080p-square, square-1080p, 4k-square. Default: a --video clip's own shape as it plays, 1080 on the short side (4:3 -> 1440x1080), else the template's dimensions (typically 1920x1080).
                    --skill=<skill>    Owning authoring skill slug (e.g. hyperframes). Stamped into hyperframes.json so every render of this project is attributed to it on anonymous telemetry, without re-passing --skill on each render. Ignored unless it is a slug.                                                                                                                                                     


